  "description": "In 2020 IShowSpeed averaged about ten live viewers. By January 2026 he had 50 million YouTube subscribers.\n\nSources:\n- Wikipedia: IShowSpeed: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/IShowSpeed\n\nFrom Wikipedia (IShowSpeed): Darren Jason Watkins Jr. was born January 21, 2005 in Cincinnati, Ohio; he registered his YouTube channel in 2016 and began consistent livestreaming in December 2017; by 2020 he averaged approximately ten concurrent viewers per broadcast; during a 2024 tour of Southeast Asia his livestream 'IRL Stream in Indonesia' marked the first time an English-speaking streamer had received one million concurrent viewers; on January 21, 2026, his 21st birthday, while touring Nigeria, his YouTube channel surpassed 50 million subscribers. Not financial advice.\n\n#shorts #ishowspeed #youtube #howtheymakemoney",
